      "id": "state-management",
      "title": "State Management",
      "description": "Zustand stores manage all frontend state. Key stores include chatStore (conversations), projectStore (workspace projects), authStore (authentication), and triggerStore (workflow triggers). Each store is a single file for simplicity.",
