      "title": "The Full Picture",
      "description": "Eigent brings together Electron + React + FastAPI + CAMEL-AI into a cohesive multi-agent desktop application. The frontend handles UI and state, the backend orchestrates AI agents with specialized toolkits, and the Electron shell delivers it as a native app. Explore each area to dive deeper!",
